 "input": "support for our app. users contact us from the in-app help button, which creates a ticket in the helpdesk with device info attached. tier 1 answers from the help centre articles (macros). if it's a bug, tier 1 reproduces it and files an issue in the engineering tracker with the ticket link. engineering fixes go out in the next app release; release notes list fixed issues. when an issue is closed the helpdesk integration reopens linked tickets so tier 1 can tell the user. refunds are via the app stores, we only send the user the link. CSAT survey after a ticket closes, scores go to the support dashboard.",
